祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":228,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":90},{"id":"jfj-q0029","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-244c42d136c1fc518809","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗六年：景耀六年（公元 263）。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":236,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-07b5919ab8c7edcb2376","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"jfj-q0187","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-d4a8e1aeaa400cdee772","layer":"original","quote":"钟会攻围汉、乐二城，遣别将进攻关口；","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":230,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":15,"end":33},{"id":"mantian-q-1d64da8522c0ce621bb3","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-dde10bd46d8f983c023a","layer":"pei","quote":"与帝舅黄门侍郎王恺，素相轻侮。恺讽司隶荀恺，令都官诬奏秀‘夜在道中，载高平国守士田兴妻’","attribution":"裴注·荀绰《冀州记》","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":280,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-aeaedf6f24d38daee210","start":100,"end":144},{"id":"wgc-q0072","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-78045a2622266a435eeb","layer":"original","quote":"蜀监军王含守乐城，护军蒋斌守汉城，兵各五千。会使护军荀恺、前将军李辅各统万人：恺围汉城，辅围乐城。会径过，西出阳安口〖7〗，遣人祭诸葛亮之墓〖8〗。使护军胡烈等行前，攻破关城〖9〗，得库藏积谷。姜维自沓中还，至阴平，合集士众，欲赴关城。未到，闻其已破，退趋白水，与蜀将张翼、廖化等合守剑阁拒会〖10〗。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":473,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151},{"id":"wgc-q0456","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-78045a2622266a435eeb","layer":"original","quote":"会使护军荀恺、前将军李辅各统万人：恺围汉城，辅围乐城","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":473,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":22,"end":48},{"id":"xuhuwang-q-d319afbd9ad28220f513","section":"chapter-027","block":"b-c4329f9d665b9d46be6e","layer":"pei","quote":"颍川荀恺，宣帝外孙，世祖姑子，自负贵戚，要与茂交；茂拒而不答，由是见怒。元康元年，杨骏被诛。恺时为尚书仆射，以茂，骏之姨弟，陷为骏党；遂枉见杀，众咸冤痛之。","attribution":"裴注·山涛启事及传补叙","section_title":"徐胡二王传第二十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0060.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-019710e8e78a8287a816","start":30,"end":108},{"id":"xunyu-e-o033b-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-e5d893f8261a404cb8f0","layer":"original","quote":"霬官至中领军。薨，谥曰贞侯，追赠骠骑将军。子恺嗣。霬妻，司马景王、文王之妹也；二王皆与亲善。咸熙中，开建五等〖7〗。以霬著勋前朝，改封恺南顿子。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":33,"end":105},{"id":"xunyu-e-p030a-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-6ee1e2aea88ba45c5c38","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝五﹞《荀氏家传》曰：“恺，晋武帝时为侍中。”","attribution":"《荀氏家传》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":188,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-1cd39ba61e7c038ca47e","start":0,"end":23},{"id":"xunyu-q-o033","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-e5d893f8261a404cb8f0","layer":"original","quote":"恽子甝，嗣为散骑常侍〖6〗，进爵广阳乡侯。年三十薨。子頵嗣。﹝四﹞霬官至中领军。薨，谥曰贞侯，追赠骠骑将军。子恺嗣。霬妻，司马景王、文王之妹也；二王皆与亲善。咸熙中，开建五等〖7〗。以霬著勋前朝，改封恺南顿子。﹝五﹞","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":108},{"id":"xunyu-q-p030","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-6ee1e2aea88ba45c5c38","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝五﹞《荀氏家传》曰：“恺，晋武帝时为侍中。”","attribution":"《荀氏家传》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":188,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-1cd39ba61e7c038ca47e","start":0,"end":23},{"id":"xunyu-q-p032","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-5ab93710c1bb7fe30998","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之按：和峤为侍中，荀顗亡没久矣。荀勖位亚台司，不与峤同班，无缘方称“侍中”。二书所云，皆为非也。考其时位，恺实当之。恺位至征西大将军。恺兄儋，少府。弟悝，护军将军，追赠车骑大将军。","attribution":"裴松之按","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-1cd39ba61e7c038ca47e","start":0,"end":92}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
